Let me tell you all I never played a Doom game before but this masterpiece converted me. Gifted to me by a dear friend that was playing nonstop, if not for him I wouldn’t buy it. I knew it was good because of reviews and people, but trying it was even better than I thought:
- Bloody, fast and crisp action on all levels;
- VULKAN astonishing optimization - 60 stable FPS, all maxed (using a ASUS 7870 paired with RYZEN 1600 and 16 GIGS ram at the time of review);
- Guns, punching, tearing;
- Level creation for multiplayer or your personal desires;
- Multiplayer with many modes.
Very easily FPS of the year 2016! If I went back now I would buy it in a heartbeat.

